                <pb facs="0396" n="292" sameAs="frus:frus1932v03/pg292"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/4111: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Switzerland
                        (Wilson), at Geneva</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-02-11T16:00:00-05:00">February 11, 1932—4
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>10. Your 17, February 11, noon. Lengthy instruction covering these matters is
                    being coded<anchor n="14" xml:id="d313-f1"/> and will reach you shortly.
                    Meanwhile, inform inquirer that negotiations are off and the field is free.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
